  "supportedClaim": "In this deterministic workspace harness, a budgeted runtime can execute multi-capability dependency closures in deterministic topological order, reuse a valid subset of bodies, materialize only missing or stale bodies, preserve exact direct-baseline outputs, and enforce a hard retained-cache ceiling even when the required transient closure is larger than that ceiling. The mechanism is conditional: explicit prewarming can lose, and zero-retention broad work can favor the simpler direct route.",
